      ],
      "rationale": "Kog'Maw is winning 54.5% in global solo queue with very low pro presence (3%). His solo queue power comes from bullying the lane early, not from his late-game scaling, which pro teams build around. We're cutting Caustic Spittle's (Q) damage at early ranks (80/125/170 -> 65/110/160) and leaving ranks 4-5 unchanged. This makes his early trades weaker (L6 lane trade 281 -> 270) and leaves his late-game DPS, siege power and utility as they are. Sim: soloq_index -0.94% (target -3% to -0.5%), pro_index +0.46% (target >= -0.5%). We chose this over a base AD nerf because base AD also cuts his late DPS and siege, which pro play relies on."
     }
    }
